# 统一行尾与二进制判定，别依赖某台机器的 core.autocrlf。
# 事实：本机 system 级 core.autocrlf=true（仓库里存 LF，工作区是 CRLF），
# 换成别的机器就不一定了 —— 这份文件让结果与机器无关。见 docs/HYGIENE.md。
* text=auto

# Windows 专用脚本：工作区一律 CRLF
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psm1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.nsh text eol=crlf

# POSIX 侧脚本与 CI 一律 LF
*.sh text eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止任何行尾/编码转换（体积大，改一个字节就要重下整包）
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.node binary
*.so binary
*.asar binary
*.7z binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
*.sf2 binary
*.sf3 binary
*.onnx binary
*.pth binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.flac binary

# 生成物在 diff 里不值得看，也不该参与合并
package-lock.json -diff
frontend/package-lock.json -diff
cloud-sync/worker/package-lock.json -diff
